    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Guur lätni Yecu ti gɔw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ kä mɔmɔ, kɛ ɣöö ca kɔn go̱l ɛ buɔ̱n nëëni mi di̱i̱t, kuanɛ tin dɛ̈c kɛ kɔn woc kɛnɛ jiäk tin ca kɔn käp, kä riɛŋnɛ kɔanɛ min te nhiamdan kɛ dhieel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä guɛcnɛ ni Yecu in la tuk kä pek ŋäthädan, min ci lia̱a̱ rut wi̱c jiaath kɛ kui̱ tɛthä lɔaac in te nhiamdɛ, kä /kenɛ riɛk kɛ duŋ po̱cä, kä nyuurɛ kui̱ cuëëc kɔam Kuɔth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Carɛ ram in ci nyier ji̱ dueeri rut, kɛ ɣöö /cia bi cuuc kä /ci lo̱ckun bi baath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä töörun kɛ duer ŋotdɛ /kenɛ ni cop kä ɣöö ba riɛmdun wuɔ̱th piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cia rieet comä tin cɔɔl yɛ gaatkɛ pa̱l ruëëc tin wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:5-6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pɛl 3:11-12.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruɔ̱tdɛ min cuuc yɛ kɛ ɣöö ɛ guurun duääc yɛ mɔ. Kuoth ciɛŋɛ yɛ ce̱tkɛ gaatkɛ, kɛ ɣöö ɛ gat in mith mi /ca ŋi̱i̱c ɛ gua̱n ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi /ca yɛ ŋi̱i̱c ce̱tkɛ gaat diaal tin kɔ̱ŋ, /ci yɛn dee a gaatkɛ, kɛ yɛn gaat läkä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te kɔn kɛ gua̱nikɔn wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n ti ŋi̱eeckɛ kɔn kä luɔ̱thnɛ kɛ. /Ci bi gɔaa ni ɣöö banɛ rɔ̱ lua̱r Gua̱n yieyni kɔn, kä banɛ tëk? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn gua̱nikɔn ca kɔn ŋi̱eec kɛ gua̱a̱th mi tɔt ce̱tkɛ min görkɛ, kä Kuoth ŋi̱i̱cɛ kɔn kɛ ɣöö banɛ gɔw, kɛ ɣöö dënɛ gɔɔydɛ nyuak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ ŋi̱i̱c kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ gua̱thni mocɛ nikɔn jiääk lɔaac a /ci mɔ a tɛ̈th lɔaac. Kä nɛy tin ci luek kɛ ŋi̱eec mocɛ kɛ mal kɛnɛ ciɛŋ cuŋni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ kapɛ tetkun tin luaaŋɛ nhial, kä jakɛ mua̱a̱lkun tin nyuän kä bum, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ja̱lɛ kɛ duɔ̱p mi cuŋ, kɛ ɣöö /ci cio̱o̱k mi ŋɔl bi thil lua̱ŋ, kä ba jak ni jɛ kä gɔaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c kɛnɛ lui̱k",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣɔ̱a̱nɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö bia cieŋ kɛ mal kɛ nɛy diaal, kɛ ciaŋ mi rɛl rɔ, kɛ ɣöö thil ram mi bi Kuäär ni Kuoth nɛnɛ a thil mal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guɛcɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö a thil ram mi /ci puɔ̱th Kuɔth bi jek, kɛnɛ ɣöö bɛ thil kɛ̈c lɔaac mi bi tuɔɔk a bi riɛk nööŋ, mi bi nɛy ti ŋuan jakä jiäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a jɛ thil ram mi gua̱n nyuɔɔni mi thil kuoth ce̱tkɛ E-thɔ, mëë ci gua̱a̱th di̱tdä diëëthdɛ kɔk ni tuɔk kua̱n kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋäc yɛn ɛ, kɛ kɔrɛ mëë go̱o̱rɛ ɣöö bɛ puɔ̱th di̱tädɛ jek, cua jɛ pën jɛ kɛ ɣöö /kenɛ gua̱a̱th mi bɛ ri̱t ni rɔ jek, a cäŋɛ ni mëë cɛ jɛ go̱r kɛ mer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö /ka̱nɛ ben wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m mi /ca dee guëër, mi te mac mi bo̱l, kɛ muth, kä gua̱a̱th jiɛthä lɔaac, kɛnɛ thul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä tekɛ jɔw kaaŋä, kɛnɛ jɔw ëë jak nɛy tëë ca liŋ kä la̱ŋkɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö bɛ thil ruac mi dɔ̱ŋ mi ba la̱t kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö /ka̱n ruac in ca la̱tkɛ luäŋ kɛ ruɔ̱t i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 19:12-13.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Cäŋɛ ni ley ci päm ɛmɛ guëërɔ, ba jɛ bök kɛ pääm a mäni lia̱a̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛpuc, ɛ dual mi di̱i̱t ɛn nëë ca nɛn a cu Muthɛ wee i̱, “Lathɛ ɣä kɛ dual.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cia ben Pääm Dha-yɔn wec Kuɔth in tëk, jɛn Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm in te nhial, kɛ ja̱a̱k nhial tin /ca dee luäŋ kɛ kuën tin ca rɔ̱ dol kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cia ben matdä keyni gan Kuɔth tin ca ciöötkiɛn gɔ̱r cieŋ nhial, cia ben kä Kuoth in la luuk nɛɛni diaal, kɛ yiey ji̱ cuŋni tin ca jak gɔw a thil diw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cia ben kä Yecu min no̱o̱ŋ mat ruac mi pay tuɔɔk, amäni kɛ riɛm in ca kith min te ni jɛn kɛ lua̱ŋ a leny riɛm E-bɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guɛcɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö /cia ruacdɛ bi lo̱k ɛn ram ɛ ruacɛ. Kɛ ɣöö mi /ka̱n rɔ̱ leny, mëë cikɛ jɛ lo̱k ɛn ram mëë ci kɛ luek wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, /canɛ rɔ̱ bi leny mi löknɛ ram in lueek kɔn nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jɔwdɛ piny lath, kä täämɛ cuɛ jɛ lat i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣag 2:6.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kɛ nyɔakdɛ /ca bi lath ni piny kärɔa bɛ jɛ lath amäni nhial.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rieet ti̱ti̱ “Kɛ nyɔakdɛ”, nyuɔthkɛ ni wuɔ̱c kä min cɛ lath ce̱tkɛ min ca cak, kɛ kui̱ kä ɣöö bi min /ca dee luäŋ kɛ lath duɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ mi canɛ ciaaŋ kuäärä mi/cɛ lath jek, kuanɛ Kuoth la̱r tɛ̈th lɔaac kɛ pa̱lan kɛ jɛ, kɛ luth kɛnɛ dual, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö Kuothdan ce̱tdɛ kɛ ɛ mac mi pɛt ŋɔak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.29",
